 "context": "The best-documented cluster in this leg. These are the 42-inch RLNG (re-gasified LNG) transmission lines SNGPL built to move imported LNG from the Karachi terminals up-country \u2014 a major national project with ECNEC approvals, contract awards and completion reporting in Business Recorder, Dawn and The News, plus SNGPL annual-report coverage. Dates should be findable to the year and possibly the month. NOTE: the deep sweep already flagged P4105 'AV29-Sahiwal' as very likely the SAME pipe as P4099 'AV29-N2' + P4100 'N2-Sahiwal' (Qadirpur Ran -> Mian Channu -> Sahiwal, i.e. an end-to-end row sitting alongside its own two segments). Do NOT re-litigate that \u2014 it is staged. But if your sources happen to settle it, note it, and be careful not to give the aggregate row a date that really belongs to one segment.",
